  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ALI SABIEH - GUELILE ROAD PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT THE CONSTRUCTION OF A BITUMINOUS ROAD OF A TOTAL LENGTH 9.15 KM BETWEEN THE CITY OF ALI SABIE AND THE VILLAGE OF GUELILE ON THE BORDER WITH ETHOPIA. THE PROJECT WILL IMPROVE THE DISPACHING CAOACITY TO THE NEIGHBOURING COUNTRIES TO BOOST THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE SERVICES SECTOR WHICH ACCOUNTS FOR 76% OF THE DJIBOUTIAN GDP</narrative>
  </description>
